  ['computed, not drawn — 15 teeth; stones from EMBRACE_DEG 42 · DRAW_DEG 12 · DROP_DEG 1.5 (makePalletFork)']: 'kinalkula, hindi iginuhit — 15 ngipin; bato EMBRACE_DEG 42 · DRAW_DEG 12 · DROP_DEG 1.5 (makePalletFork)',
