  ['the spring (§268): a 0.100 mm torsion spiral on the hammer\'s post — fall 53.2 → 1.53 ms, blow 17 nJ → 20.5 µJ']: 'ang spring (§268): isang 0.100 mm na torsion spiral sa poste ng martilyo — bagsak 53.2 → 1.53 ms, palo 17 nJ → 20.5 µJ',
  ['the case (§269): the foot\'s 0.31 N drives 40.4 g as a rigid body — the fundamental 31.3 → 40.7 dBA, the overtone 52.8 → 55.2']: 'ang kaha (§269): ang 0.31 N ng paa ay nagpapagalaw sa 40.4 g bilang matigas na katawan — pundamental 31.3 → 40.7 dBA, overtone 52.8 → 55.2',
